{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260bU0UrZRZG1795483331.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>神舟二十四號載人飛船明早八時十八分發射。</p><p></p><p>三名航天員人選包括指令長湯洪波、航天員武毅，及來自巴基斯坦的穆罕默德‧齊尚‧阿里，是中國太空站首次迎來外籍航天員，湯洪波也將成為首位三次到訪中國太空站的航天員。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_CN.SHENZHOU.0900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iPxNvI3Hhc1795485217.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_CN.SHENZHOU.0900_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AUJV3SX7kV1795485233.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_CN.SHENZHOU.0900_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fVX7k4iogc1795485249.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中國載人航天工程辦公室又公布，神舟二十三號指令長朱楊柱將在軌駐留一年，而巴基斯坦航天員將短期駐留一周，之後隨神舟二十三號兩名航天員，包括香港載荷專家黎家盈，一起返回地球。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:03:58.673754+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T01:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T22:17:33.739791+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:57:17.894530+00:00","content_hash":"e30a5e29b84e45d8f15da4a45a4e25e1948614a0b12a5994e31a18ffc55b74de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:03:58.673754+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}